   "zh-Hant": "埃及赫迪夫國：名義上屬鄂圖曼蘇丹宗主權，1882 年起由英國佔領；1914-12-18 英國宣布終止鄂圖曼宗主權、改為英國保護國。形狀沿用埃及蘇丹國第一筆紀錄，沒有另外查證 1908–1914 年間西界與西奈一帶的邊界細節。",
   "en": "Khedivate of Egypt: nominally under the suzerainty of the Ottoman Sultan and under British occupation since 1882, until Britain declared the suzerainty terminated and a protectorate established on 18 December 1914. Shape copied from the first record of the Sultanate."
